&lt;p&gt;Wrike is looking for a part-time Receptionist to join our Workplace Operations Team. In this role, you will be the face of our office, creating a welcoming and positive experience for employees, visitors, and partners. Reporting to the WPO Manager, you will play an important part in ensuring the office runs smoothly by providing day-to-day administrative and workplace support. This role is essential to maintaining an organized, vibrant, and service-oriented office environment that reflects Wrike’s values.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcome employees, visitors, and guests with a friendly, professional, and helpful attitude&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the first point of contact at reception and help create a positive office experience&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the smooth day-to-day operation of the workplace and general office coordination&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with vendors and assist with office-related services&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and respond to administrative and workplace-related requests&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the planning and execution of internal events and office activities&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide travel and visitor support as needed&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with employee onboarding and offboarding processes&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle courier, mail, and delivery services&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage kitchen supplies, snacks, and general office stock&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support office supplies procurement and inventory management&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with swag production and distribution&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support health and safety processes and help maintain workplace standards&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English and Greek&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good organizational and time management skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in administration, reception, or office support&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple tasks in a dynamic office environment&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sense of responsibility and attention to detail&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service-oriented mindset with a proactive and helpful approach&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively as part of a team&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standout Qualities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive, upbeat, and welcoming personality&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
