&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and confidence interacting with employees, visitors, and vendors&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem-solving approach&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to create a warm, professional, and well-organized office atmosphere&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Dynamics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the WPO Manager and work closely with the broader Workplace Operations team. In this role, you will collaborate with internal employees, external visitors, and vendors, helping ensure a seamless office experience for everyone. You will join a supportive, service-driven team focused on creating a workplace where people feel welcomed, productive, and connected.&lt;/p&gt;
