&lt;p&gt;This is a part-time, office-based role at the center of Wrike’s workplace experience. You will work in a collaborative and dynamic environment where flexibility, teamwork, and a hands-on approach are key. The role involves daily interaction with employees, visitors, and service providers, with a strong focus on hospitality, coordination, and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
