&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Wrike continues to scale globally, we’re reimagining how People Operations delivers consistent, high-quality employee experiences while maintaining operational agility and compliance across regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior People Operations Specialist (AMS) to support and execute core People Operations processes across our U.S. and Costa Rica workforce. This role sits at the center of day-to-day People Operations execution — ensuring employee processes are delivered accurately, efficiently, and compliantly across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the center of day-to-day People Operations execution — ensuring employee processes are delivered accurately, efficiently, and compliantly across the employee lifecycle. Beyond execution, this role serves as a trusted first-line resource for managers and employees, providing timely, sound guidance on lifecycle, leave, accommodation, and employee relations matters and partnering with leadership and counsel on more complex situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Dynamics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a hands-on individual contributor within a global People Operations model, you will partner closely with the Director, Global People Operations, Team Leads, and cross-functional stakeholders. From onboarding through offboarding, benefits administration through payroll inputs, and compliance-related processes through systems support, you will execute and coordinate core People Operations activities across jurisdictions while maintaining accuracy, responsiveness, and compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is built for someone who thrives in a lean, fast-moving environment — balancing precision with empathy, operational rigor with thoughtful engagement, and autonomy with sound judgment. You’re comfortable working remotely, collaborating across time zones, and contributing meaningfully to a distributed global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👥Employee Lifecycle Experience &amp;amp; Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute and support employee lifecycle processes across the U.S. and Costa Rica workforce, ensuring operational accuracy, responsiveness, and compliance throughout the employee journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and advise on day-to-day lifecycle administration and coordination, including onboarding, internal mobility, compensation changes, leave transitions, offboarding, terminations, and employee documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure lifecycle processes are completed accurately, timely, and with a strong employee service and advisory mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with HRBPs, Payroll, IT, Finance, and managers to coordinate smooth employee transitions and operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding experiences, employee communications, and regional operational initiatives that contribute to a positive employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify operational inefficiencies and support process improvements that enhance consistency, documentation quality, and team efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized and accurate employee records, documentation, and system updates across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✨Benefits, Leave &amp;amp; Wellness Programs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer, advise on, and support benefits and leave programs across the U.S. and Costa Rica while ensuring alignment with local regulations, company policies, and operational requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support country-specific health, retirement, insurance, statutory leave, and wellness programs through day-to-day administration, vendor coordination, employee support, and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a resource for employees navigating enrollments, life events, leave requests, and benefits-related questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with vendors and internal stakeholders to support timely issue resolution and accurate administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear employee communication and support regarding benefits and leave programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve operational efficiency, documentation, and consistency across benefits-related processe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚙️&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Governance, Compliance &amp;amp; Risk Stewardship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support compliance with applicable employment and workforce regulations across assigned jurisdictions while maintaining operational integrity and documentation standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain alignment with employment, workforce, and data privacy requirements in both the U.S. and Costa Rica.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support compliance-related operational processes, including background checks, policy acknowledgments, reporting requirements, and audit preparation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate compliance concerns, documentation gaps, or operational risks to appropriate stakeholders when identified.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain organized documentation and records to support operational governance and audit readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to ensure people operations processes are compliant, sustainable, and operationally effective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📝 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payroll Inputs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support payroll accuracy by ensuring timely and accurate employee data updates and payroll inputs across systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Submit payroll inputs, including new hires, terminations, compensation updates, bonuses, and leave adjustments accurately and on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure employee data changes are correctly reflected in HR systems prior to payroll processing deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Payroll and Finance to resolve discrepancies, validate changes, and support payroll processing timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high standards of data accuracy and documentation integrity across systems and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📊&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Optimization, Systems &amp;amp; AI-Enabled Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support operational efficiency by leveraging HR systems, automation, and AI-enabled tools to reduce manual work and improve service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
