&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; High proficiency in Intrusion Detection, Exploit Dev, &lt;strong&gt;Linux Operations&lt;/strong&gt; and Security Understanding&lt;/p&gt;
