&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;Wrike is the most powerful work management platform. Built for teams and organizations looking to collaborate, create, and exceed every day, Wrike brings everyone and all work into a single place to remove complexity, increase productivity, and free people up to focus on their most purposeful work.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our vision:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;A world where everyone is free to focus on their most purposeful work, together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This dynamic role is a strategic hybrid, combining the technical ingenuity of a &lt;strong&gt;Solutions Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; with the implementation mastery of a &lt;strong&gt;Professional Services Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;. Your mission is to serve as a trusted advisor for Wrike Japan’s high-value clients, bridging the gap between complex business challenges and transformative digital solutions. By leveraging deep expertise in Wrike’s platform, you will design, demonstrate, and deploy high-impact workflows that maximize ROI and drive long-term organizational success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Articulate the value of Wrike’s core workflows (Campaign Management, PPM, Creative Production, etc.) to prospective and existing clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Sales to navigate complex scoping, conduct technical discovery, and deliver tailored demos that map Wrike’s capabilities to unique business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Implementation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the full customer journey—from initial design and configuration to rollout and adoption monitoring—ensuring a seamless transition and rapid time-to-value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Product, Marketing, and Engineering teams to influence the product roadmap and develop short-term workarounds for unique client requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a workflow expert, coaching junior team members on consulting best practices and technical delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; B.S. in Computer Engineering, Software Engineering, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years in Sales/Solutions Engineering and 5+ years in project management or SaaS-based consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of Project Portfolio Management (PPM), Client Service Delivery, and Product Lifecycle Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;APIs&lt;/strong&gt; to create integrated ecosystem solutions and automated workflow environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; Formal certification in project management (Agile, PMI, Prince2, or Lean) and a firm grasp of &lt;strong&gt;Change Management&lt;/strong&gt; principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional presentation skills with the ability to handle objections and influence executive-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standout Qualities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Education:&lt;/strong&gt; An MBA or relevant Master’s degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certified Presenter:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior &lt;strong&gt;Demo2Win&lt;/strong&gt; certification or formal sales demonstration training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wrike Insider:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience as a Wrike Power User, Administrator, or Consultant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem Architect:&lt;/strong&gt; The ability to position Wrike within complex tech stacks, ensuring interoperability with third-party tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovative Problem-Solver:&lt;/strong&gt; A creative mindset that thrives on &quot;unsticking&quot; complex processes and designing non-traditional solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Dynamics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a high-energy, collaborative team in Japan that sits at the intersection of Sales and Customer Success. Reporting to the regional leadership, you will work closely with Account Executives to win new business and Technical Account Managers to ensure long-term health. We pride ourselves on a culture of &lt;strong&gt;accountability, empathy, and collective winning&lt;/strong&gt;—where we put the team and the customer first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Work Style:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wrike is a pioneer in the collaborative work management space, and we &quot;drink our own champagne&quot; by using our platform to manage every project and milestone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A blend of in-office collaboration and remote focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll live in &lt;strong&gt;Wrike&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt;, and various integration platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodology:&lt;/strong&gt; We lean heavily into &lt;strong&gt;Agile&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Lean&lt;/strong&gt; principles to remain iterative and fast-moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Wrike Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Unlike competitors, we focus on deep vertical integration—offering specialized Solution Deployment Packages that solve specific industry pain points out of the box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
