&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you a passionate Backend Engineer? This isn’t a typical job posting - it’s an invitation to connect with Wrike for future possibilities. By joining our talent pool, you can introduce yourself and learn more about our culture, projects, and technology. We’re always eager to meet talented professionals, even if we don’t have an open position right now. Apply today if you’d like to start a conversation and discover more about life at Wrike.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
