&lt;li&gt;Tech focus areas include: Java/JVM-based services, PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, Kubernetes, RabbitMQ/Kafka, and observability/monitoring tools.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage the use of modern AI-based tooling and coding agents as part of daily development and troubleshooting workflows.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work is organized with an emphasis on impact and reliability goals rather than ticket volume, giving you room for deep work and long-term improvements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work mode (Prague, Czech Republic / Nicosia, Cyprus), with flexibility to balance focused individual work and collaborative sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
